# Web app settings (Vite). Copy to web/.env.local (git-ignored) and fill in locally;
# on the hosting (Render), set them as environment variables of the web service and
# rebuild: Vite puts VITE_ values into the build. Never commit real values.
# Keys and quotas: docs/runbooks/08-google-maps-keys.md (ADR-033).

# Google Maps Platform (the only map provider): browser key restricted to the app's
# web addresses and to Maps JavaScript API + Geocoding API; Map ID of a JavaScript
# vector map. Without both, map areas show "Map not configured"; the rest works.
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_MAP_ID=
